Mark 13:1 , Christ foretells the destruction of the temple;
Mark 13:9 , the persecutions for the gospel;
Mark 13:10 , that the gospel must be preached to all nations;
Mark 13:14 , that great calamities shall happen to the Jews;
Mark 13:24 , and the manner of his coming to judgment;
Mark 13:32 , the hour whereof being known to none, every man is to watch and pray, that we be not found unprovided, when he comes to each one particularly by death.
